  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes a 3-qubit, 4-layer gate-based hybrid quantum neural network with genetic-algorithm tuning to predict stock closing prices from 4M+ tweets and historical data for six companies (AAPL, AMZN, GOOG, GOOG-L, MSFT, TSLA). It reports very high predictive performance, with accuracy values around 99.15% to 99.96% and low errors such as RMSE 0.23–0.64, but the explainability analysis finds the tweet sentiment feature has negligible influence on predictions.",
